# /mnt/e is the user's real Windows drive - a file touched from the Windows side (editor,
# tool) can silently flip to CRLF, which then shows up as a spurious full-file diff on the
# next commit from here (LF). Force LF for text files regardless of which OS last touched
# them, so line endings never become part of an unrelated diff again.
* text=auto eol=lf
